            <title>[LUDOC-582] Document the lnetctl stats p2pdma_send_count and p2pdma_recv_count counters</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LUDOC-582</link>
                <project id="10070" key="LUDOC">Lustre Documentation</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19848" title="Implement p2pdma support for Lustre" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-19848"&gt;LU-19848&lt;/a&gt; added two counters to the lnetctl stats show output: p2pdma_send_count and p2pdma_recv_count. They count the LNet messages that use P2P DMA memory, for example GPU pages in bulk I/O. Users can check with them that GPU I/O uses P2P DMA. The Lustre Operations Manual must document the two counters in the section Showing LNet Traffic Statistics.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
